graph TD
    A[Glucose Availability] --> B{Metabolic State?}
    B -->|High Glucose| C[Glycogen Synthesis]
    B -->|Low Glucose| D[Glycogen Breakdown]
    
    C --> E[Glycogen Synthase]
    E --> F[UDP-Glucose Formation]
    F --> G[Glycogen Chain Extension]
    G --> H[Glycogen Branching Enzyme]
    H --> I[Glycogen Storage]
    
    D --> J[Glycogen Phosphorylase]
    J --> K[Glucose-1-Phosphate]
    K --> L[Debranching Enzyme]
    L --> M[Glucose-6-Phosphate]
    M --> N[Glucose Production]
    
    %% Regulation
    I --> O[Glycogen Levels]
    N --> P[Glucose Levels]
    O --> Q{Glycogen Sufficient?}
    P --> R{Glucose Sufficient?}
    Q -->|Yes| S[Glycogen Synthesis Inhibition]
    Q -->|No| T[Glycogen Synthesis Continuation]
    R -->|Yes| U[Glycogen Breakdown Inhibition]
    R -->|No| V[Glycogen Breakdown Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    W[Glycogen Synthase] --> E
    X[Glycogen Phosphorylase] --> J
    Y[Branching Enzyme] --> H
    Z[Debranching Enzyme] --> L
    AA[UDP-Glucose] --> F
    BB[Glucose-1-Phosphate] --> K
    CC[Glucose-6-Phosphate] --> M
    DD[Glycogen] --> I
    
